<title>UK: Kredietbank unit sets 55 million Ecu 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank unit sets 55 million Ecu 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    55 MLN ECU    COUPON     *5.0	MATURITY    06.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE TO FOUR, 7.125 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
